{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舊志云唐貞觀十年夏月白龍與烏龍鬬于虞山之東北\n衝山而去山裂成澗則又與白龍祠事相涉三說未知孰是"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "鄭虎臣吳都文粹同"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寳祐志同"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一作炤又作曜又作朗"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "通"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "集作寺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有序"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "餘七咏俱別見"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一作止"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "別親"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一作真"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一作僧"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "續吳都文粹同"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "B34n0193_p0212a07"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "T37n1763_p0381b16"}
{"id": null, "n": "b019001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_b019001", "type": "orig", "text": "宣化門、厲壇。"}
{"id": null, "n": "b020001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_b020001", "type": "orig", "text": "洗馬池、伏虎塘橋、周孝子墓、報慈橋、桃源澗。"}
{"id": null, "n": "b021001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_b021001", "type": "orig", "text": "興福三門、茶菴、頂山路、四高僧墓、萬松書院、高林菴。"}
{"id": null, "n": "b022001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_b022001", "type": "orig", "text": "興福寺、舜井、宗教院。"}
{"id": null, "n": "b023001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_b023001", "type": "orig", "text": "光明菴、石門峯、劍門、拂水巖、朱砂洞、降龍橋、龍鬪澗。"}
{"id": null, "n": "b024001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_b024001", "type": "orig", "text": "空心潭、瓔珞柏、空心亭、高僧殿、觀堂、觀音殿、白蓮池、救虎閣、東寮、地藏殿、雲會堂、天王殿、團瓢。"}
{"id": null, "n": "b025001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_b025001", "type": "orig", "text": "大殿、西寮、西房、香積廚、準提殿、韋馱殿、菜園、蘇先子後圖、蘇先。"}
{"id": null, "n": "b103001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_b103001", "type": "orig", "text": "「本」字底本原闕，茲參本志 p.121 補入。"}
{"id": null, "n": "b002a0101", "target": "#nkr_note_add_b002a0101", "type": "add", "text": "此「版本說明」一文原為書本開頭無頁碼之插頁，今為標記架構上之需要移到此處，且以 pb002a 為虛擬頁欄碼。"}
